  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="3bf09c73-0e42-5438-8ec2-b5b4722a6061" activityNameId="b4174539-2a6b-5c22-bb27-338f5a7ea593" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Production efforts, transistors</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Production efforts, transistors
Data are a rough estimation of the average production efforts over all types of transistors. Data for auxillaries, energy, emissions and waste are taken from a dataset ouf of an international LCI database. Infrastructure and transportation efforts are based on own assumptions. Updates were made in 2023, showing that 20% energy reduction is achieved; UUID: d853443c-5d22-3201-98ab-a8c87d84de29
This module includes auxillary and energy consumption, emissions (air, water) and waste amounts, as well as an estimation of the efforts for transportation and of the infrastructure for the production of transistors.
Location: Data from literature – here representing the global situation.
Technology: average production technology comprising Si-crystal die bonding; wire bonding; encapsulation; plating; triming; forming and marking.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: estimation - based on literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d853443c-5d22-3201-98ab-a8c87d84de29.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
